"CO2. These do not compete with the targets above — a target is the number to"
" reach, these describe how the crop behaves on the way there, and only the "
"environment coordinator reads them when it is set to control for "
"photosynthesis. Leave the whole block empty if you do not run that. Do not "
"guess: a wrong number makes control quietly wrong. Templates come filled in "
"from published figures."
msgstr ""

